        {
          "text": "Wan, Joisiraili, jocway ri Were i wi migam, Jolevi, jokur ma Ot pa Were, jower, jotic ma Ot pa Were, gi jono je ma jopokere kwoŋ jopath ma jobedo i lowo mawan, luwo Cik pa Were, wan, kanyacel gi mon mawan, kodi nyithindho mawan ma joniaŋ gima watimo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
