        },
        {
          "text": "wariwere ka gi jotel mawan i kwoŋirok ni walatimo gima Cik pa Were m'omiyo ŋeca pere Musa waco, walawinjo cik pa Rwoth, aka walakuro cik pere je gi fonji mere je. Ka wakitimo ameno walwoŋo lam kwoŋ wan.",
