          "text": "Walamiyo gigipiny ma mitere i Ot pa Were i lamo; mugat maleŋ, mic ma kisi ndelo ma ŋano, ogwaŋe awaŋa kisi ndelo paka cowirok, mic maleŋ ri Sabato, Kalima ma dwe manyen, kodi kalima man je, mic ma cwako reco pa Isiraili, kodi giman je ma mitere i Ot pa Were.",
