                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili kodi Jolevi joripo tero mic ma ŋano, vini, kodi mo i kisikin ma kan kama ikan'iye gigipiny ma Ot pa Were aka ma jocway ri Were i wi migam, jokur, kodi jower ma jonitie i weso ma tic jobed'iye.",
          "type": "text",
